DTSTAMP:20261128T114204Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261204T160000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261204T180000
SUMMARY:BOXXER presents Fight Night: London
LOCATION:Copper Box Arena\, Bethnal Green North West
DESCRIPTION:British star Adam Azim faces the biggest test of his career whe
 
n he takes on Mexico?s Gabriel Gollaz Valenzuela in an IBF World Super Ligh
 
tweight Title Eliminator on December 4\, at the Copper Box Arena in London.
 
 The 24-year-old is on the brink of his first world title opportunity after
 
 a blistering third-round stoppage of Steve Claggett in May. Valenzuela\, 3
 
2\, from Guadalajara\, has fought former world champion Subriel Matías and
 
 lost a controversial split decision to Lindolfo Delgado in another IBF eli
 
minator. He has also won on British soil\, beating Azim?s former stablemate
 
 Robbie Davies Jr in London in 2021 to claim the IBF International title. O
 
n the undercard\, Francesca Hennessy faces France?s unbeaten Johanna Wonyou
 
 for the WBC Interim World Bantamweight Title. Unbeaten welterweights Ellio
 
t Whale and Bobby Faulkner meet for the WBA Continental title. Olympic bron
 
ze medallist Frazer Clarke returns\, and unbeaten Hassan Azim\, Adam?s olde
 
r brother\, takes on undefeated Ruben Torres. Tickets & info: https://www.t
 
icketmaster.co.uk/boxxer-presents-fight-night-london-london-04-12-2026/even
 
t/35006564D6228C6B
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.co.uk/boxxer-presents-fight-night-london-londo
 
n-04-12-2026/event/35006564D6228C6B
END:VEVENT
